codex
The hide/show check caught another lifecycle issue: Avalonia fires `Opened` again when a hidden window is shown, so initialization needed a guard to avoid duplicate hooks and hotkey registration. That fix is in the final build.

The remaining work is user acceptance of the physical inputs and visible shell behavior. I’ll record the tested results and those pending checks in the reports.


